# Festival-day barks (T-123): a short line each villager may say in a bubble on a festival day. Compiled to zz_fs_festival_barks.json.

addto npc.wren.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => wren.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: Festival day! Everyone's my friend until the cider runs out.

addto npc.hazel.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => hazel.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: (A festival. Loud, bright, and surprisingly pleasant.)

addto npc.bram.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => bram.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: Hm. Festival. Good day for small iron.

addto npc.tilda.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => tilda.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: Festival, dear! The slate's closed and the ribbons are open.

addto npc.juno.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => juno.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: It's festival day! I labeled my good shirt! It says 'Shirt (Festive)'!

addto npc.piper.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => piper.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: Festival! I have a song! Please clap at the bridge!

addto npc.marcus.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => marcus.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: Festival. The stalls are level. Enjoy them.

addto npc.odalys.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => odalys.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: Festival. Drink water between cups. That is a gentle order.

addto npc.felix.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => felix.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: Festival day. Even the fish are quiet. They're listening.

addto npc.dorian.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => dorian.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: ...Loud. Warm. I'll stay a while.

addto npc.elara.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => elara.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: Festival! I knitted the square a blanket! It's a very small square!

addto npc.ione.bark
0 festival.in:==0 => ione.bark.festival.1 cat=bark :: A festival. The library's open, but I'm out. Come say hello.
